# Server-only application entry settings. Never use NEXT_PUBLIC_ for secrets.
# Generate local secrets with: npm run entry:setup
# Production: use the public HTTPS portal origin and set secrets in the host dashboard.
# Local development: override in .env.local with http://localhost:<your actual port>.
# Local-only entry is automatic; it remains disabled in production.
